{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/503c3cd98743b34fc60092c3ec751f4d.avif?t=1768205850\" width=616 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/1872bffaf123686bb674fff199f7bb21.webp?t=1768205850\" width=616 height=39 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the first one in these Lost Lands. It is time to build, explore and discover! The wondrous old world holds a lot of mysteries, and you get to be the one to uncover them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/626e8cf5d733a6c309b6b86a6ae6b514.webp?t=1768205850\" width=616 height=40 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/860c589bd825c07a8ca800001b0c3772.poster.avif?t=1768205850\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/860c589bd825c07a8ca800001b0c3772.webm?t=1768205850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/860c589bd825c07a8ca800001b0c3772.mp4?t=1768205850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with a lonely bonfire and a lot of unexplored lands around you. Uncover the territory around to discover new places to build, supplies to gather, ruins to explore, runestones to study\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/376ac1a0d44b97571aa220cefdc0e6b6.webp?t=1768205850\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/b2e1930e3598ee8ddc6c48ef32608856.poster.avif?t=1768205850\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/b2e1930e3598ee8ddc6c48ef32608856.webm?t=1768205850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/b2e1930e3598ee8ddc6c48ef32608856.mp4?t=1768205850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each building in Lost Lands has a function and many open up new ways to interact with the world. Build a lumberjacks shack - now you can chop down the forest tiles for wood. Or cut down thorns blocking your way. Or.. many other things. As you expand, so does your toolbelt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/c4d1fbd996088a498279dc8225eb2b9b.webp?t=1768205850\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/c954d3181620d22a01a630904f30341d.poster.avif?t=1768205850\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/c954d3181620d22a01a630904f30341d.webm?t=1768205850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/c954d3181620d22a01a630904f30341d.mp4?t=1768205850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Jarl you start the game with has a personal approach to building the settlement - with unique construction trees, talents and goals. Use their strength to adapt to the situations you find yourself in!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/fd13475cfd6e4647ba595fd7f11742b9.webp?t=1768205850\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/facb911bbf172a8c7d0ecb2577d3e429.poster.avif?t=1768205850\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/facb911bbf172a8c7d0ecb2577d3e429.webm?t=1768205850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/facb911bbf172a8c7d0ecb2577d3e429.mp4?t=1768205850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every playthrough has a unique landscape, environment and climate! As days and nights go by, so will the seasons, each bringing about changes to your town and the surroundings. Each season also comes with its own set of normal, and sometimes bizarre weather conditions. Prepare for the harsh winter, and use the conditions to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/114e4514ef2671c30e74c51c30d9e97f.webp?t=1768205850\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is nothing to worry about. You cannot lose the game. Grab hot cocoa, wrap yourself in the blanket, relax, and enjoy the process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2345940?t=1768205850","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2345940?t=1768205850","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/2b36ceef47bc16f253f0e291184c5c91b45a4b5b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768205850","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/2b36ceef47bc16f253f0e291184c5c91b45a4b5b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768205850","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3775310,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/503c3cd98743b34fc60092c3ec751f4d.avif?t=1768205850\" width=616 height=198 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/1872bffaf123686bb674fff199f7bb21.webp?t=1768205850\" width=616 height=39 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the first one in these Lost Lands. It is time to build, explore and discover! The wondrous old world holds a lot of mysteries, and you get to be the one to uncover them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"