"bb_paragraph\" >Each building in Lost Lands has a function and many open up new ways to interact with the world. Build a lumberjacks shack - now you can chop down the forest tiles for wood. Or cut down thorns blocking your way. Or.. many other things. As you expand, so does your toolbelt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/c4d1fbd996088a498279dc8225eb2b9b.webp?t=1768205850\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/c954d3181620d22a01a630904f30341d.poster.avif?t=1768205850\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/c954d3181620d22a01a630904f30341d.webm?t=1768205850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/c954d3181620d22a01a630904f30341d.mp4?t=1768205850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Jarl you start the game with has a personal approach to building the settlement - with unique construction trees, talents and goals. Use their strength to adapt to the situations you find yourself in!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/fd13475cfd6e4647ba595fd7f11742b9.webp?t=1768205850\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345940/extras/facb911bbf172a8c7d0ecb2577d3e429.poster.avif?t=1768205850